    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12130" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπῐσόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make equal,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὑτὸν ἀ. τοῖς κλιντῆρσιν,</span> in
			reference to Procrustes, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Thes.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Pr.Im.</u>
				13
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be made equal,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ ἀξίῃ τῶν φορτίων</span>
			<i>to</i> their value, <i><span class="en">
